& 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$G=\\begin{bmatrix}0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $H$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\n- $I$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, ${i}_{21}=0.1\\ne 0$).\n\n- $G$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\nTherefore, only $H$ and $G$ are zero matrices."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262599 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1525f01b-2ae2-5dd4-b801-c694ed68add4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463574} {:answer/id #uuid "13bd1c8a-3615-5ab3-bbc6-12281ca6492f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463575}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463575} :answer-field/id #uuid "a12cf060-14bb-5c32-ae71-e67eabb18f24" :answer-field/key "R" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464721} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee158078-6dff-5178-8bc6-c42103f550f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463576} {:answer/id #uuid "743db0c8-4fc8-51e5-b59f-4bc00f45f0f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463577}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463577} :answer-field/id #uuid "b9435bb1-b983-5f11-84f3-852885905526" :answer-field/key "S" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464722} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "390b5d43-ed4f-5bab-9e5b-1bd6bc72af7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463578} {:answer/id #uuid "d2573021-ba50-5806-b30b-c6a0c1437efc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/t